  "tips": "Notes:\nWhen I’m not in the mood to take out my blender, I just combine the yogurt and pudding in a bowl, mix it well and refrigerate it until the yogurt has solidified. Then I add the crushed pineapple and I have a delicious smoothie, without having a blender jar to clean.\nDescription:\nYou probably have tons of smoothie recipes up your sleeve, but this one is something special. The diet pudding adds amazing texture and taste to this refreshing smoothie.",
